# REELYOU — Approved Splash & Welcome (Locked)

Splash and Welcome are **approved production screens**. Preserve them exactly unless the user explicitly requests a change.

## Do NOT change

- Splash or Welcome layout, composition, spacing, or typography
- Approved asset references in `splashAssets.ts`, `branding.ts`, or screen files
- Logo size, position, or logo-to-blurb spacing on Welcome
- Welcome background scale, crop, or celestial-ring framing
- CTA button or SIGN IN link styling/placement
- Transparent Welcome logo rendering (no boxes, cards, or theme surfaces behind the logo)

## Asset rules

- Use canonical paths documented in `src/assets/branding/README.md`
- Do not swap transparent PNGs for JPEGs or fake PNGs
- Do not pull assets from Downloads, chat attachments, or paths outside the repo
- Welcome renders `reelyou-welcome-logo-white-tagline-cropped.png` — do not revert to legacy JPEG lockups for Welcome

## Theme system boundary

- Splash and Welcome remain **locked cinematic dark** routes
- Do not apply global theme styling, theme-based logo switching, or light-mode tokens to these screens
- Theme work applies only to **post-Welcome** screens unless explicitly instructed otherwise

## Allowed without approval

- Bug fixes that do not alter the approved visual appearance
- Performance/responsiveness improvements that preserve the approved look
- Documentation and asset-preservation updates requested by the user

## Before any visual change

Stop and ask for explicit user approval. State the exact files, properties, and visual delta.
